            "review_title": "Review at Istanbul Gourmet Da Nang",
            "review_text": "Scott Dubai\nDubai, United Arab Emirates209 contributions\n0\nTurkish food on your doorstep\nAug 2026 • Family\nThe Middle East meets Asian cuisine \nLiving in the Middle East I know all about their foods etc and had to try this restaurant and wasn’t disappointed…\nVariety of starters and mains to please everyone.\nThe chef himself was from Turkey which helps with the authenticity of the food and flavors.\nHummus, lentil soup, shawarma etc are all worth ordering.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 20, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
