            "review_text": "izziali\nlondon156 contributions\n0\nVery tasty food and great service\nFeb 2026 • Friends\nThe food here is amazing very tasty, service can’t fault it at all, it’s reasonably priced.\n\nThe place is always busy we got there the first time at around 8:30 and there was no chance of a table we then went around 5pm and managed to get a table and even then they were busy. \n\nIf you definitely decide to go i would recommend either making a reservation or going early it is worth it.\nRead more\nWritten February 26, 2026\nIstanbul Gourme... D\nThank you very much for your lovely review. :)\nWritten February 27, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
